Maya: Time for The Ticker.

19
00:00:53,150 --> 00:01:01,240
Maya: At Thursday's close, the S&P 500 finished at 7,176, down 2.0 percent.

20
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:06,820
Maya: The Nasdaq Composite was down 2.3 percent and the Dow was down 2.2 percent.

21
