473
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:56,130
Maya: It could be a cheap marketing stunt to shift sentiment, but no city response yet.

474
00:26:56,730 --> 00:27:01,870
Alex: My read is that Amazon is testing political persuasion, but we’re missing the data.

475
00:27:02,260 --> 00:27:05,310
Maya: If they can’t prove targeting, it’s just a headline grabber.

476
00:27:05,660 --> 00:27:08,830
Alex: It feels like a tactic, not a real policy push.

477
00:27:10,510 --> 00:27:14,330
