486
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:41,750
Alex: Looks like Google is trying to stay ahead of the curve.

487
00:27:42,260 --> 00:27:44,930
Maya: What gives it the extra power to tap into local files?

488
00:27:45,230 --> 00:27:46,410
Maya: So it’s not a jailbreak.

489
00:27:46,860 --> 00:27:51,970
Alex: Right, the agent needs user‑selected app access and shows a live preview; the

490
00:27:51,970 --> 00:27:54,350
