491
00:27:54,790 --> 00:27:56,410
Maya: And who’s cutting the ribbon on the feature?

492
00:27:56,910 --> 00:28:01,850
Alex: Google’s product team, but they’re rolling it out only in English for US users

493
00:28:01,850 --> 00:28:02,610
Alex: right now.

494
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:06,010
Maya: Timing looks like a heads‑up before Apple’s new restrictions.

495
00:28:06,650 --> 00:28:13,250
Alex: Yeah, Apple’s macOS 27.3 beta already has a preview of the tighter disk‑access

496
00:28:13,250 --> 00:28:16,730
Alex: controls, so Google is probably testing the waters.

497
00:28:17,420 --> 00:28:21,110
