502
00:28:30,850 --> 00:28:33,830
Alex: So it’s still a controlled environment, not a jailbreak.

503
00:28:34,420 --> 00:28:37,630
Maya: Exactly, but it’s still a step toward broader local access.

504
00:28:38,310 --> 00:28:41,230
