531
00:30:17,760 --> 00:30:22,560
Maya: And the renewable push—solar is set to dominate, but only if the grid keeps up.

532
00:30:23,280 --> 00:30:28,150
Alex: My read is that the grid’s expansion is the real bottleneck, not the power itself.

533
00:30:29,060 --> 00:30:33,040
Maya: So the market will keep betting on renewables while infrastructure plays catch‑up.

534
00:30:33,530 --> 00:30:38,570
