557
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:46,710
Maya: Radiators and heat pipes handle it, no extra cooling.

558
00:31:47,200 --> 00:31:50,910
Alex: Still, launching in 2029 is a long road.

559
00:31:51,490 --> 00:31:54,670
Maya: It’s a strategic move to tap solar energy for compute.

560
00:31:56,410 --> 00:31:57,410
